      "mpn": "STM32G031F6P6",
      "note": "Interface coprocessor (replaces TCA9535 + SC16IS740 after review). I2C target to the reader (address 0x30, firmware). USART2 with hardware driver-enable (PA1 RTS_DE, PA2 TX, PA3 RX) for OSDP; timer-driven Wiegand; independent watchdog releases Wiegand/tamper/buzzer outputs (all default high-Z with gate pulldowns). OSDP Secure Channel stays on the ESP32 (keys never leave it). Bonded pads: pin 1 = PB7/PB8, pin 20 = PB3-PB6, pin 15 = PA8/PB0-PB2, pin 16 = PA9/PA11: keep the unused twins as inputs. Piezo BZ1 bridge-driven by TIM1_CH1 (PA8, pin 15) and TIM1_CH1N (PA7, pin 14) in complementary PWM at about 4 kHz: about 6.6 Vp-p across the transducer. I2C1 on PB6/PB7 and TIM1 on PA7/PA8 (AF2) to be confirmed in CubeMX. Factory programming over SWD (J3).",
